{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/cnn/posts/theres-no-evidence-that-hundreds-of-thousands-of-ballots-went-undelivered-while/10161443290586509/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/cnn/posts/theres-no-evidence-that-hundreds-of-thousands-of-ballots-went-undelivered-while/10161443290586509/","title":"CNN","description":"There's no evidence that hundreds of thousands of ballots went undelivered. While there were roughly 300,000 ballots that did not have delivery scans, that doesn't mean they weren't delivered.","language":"en","text":"There's no evidence that hundreds of thousands of ballots went undelivered. While there were roughly 300,000 ballots that did not have delivery scans, that doesn't mean they weren't delivered.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n2.3K comments\n\n646 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nSusan Brewer\n\nThe delivery scan is important. Room for fraud.\n\n12\n\nView all 4 replies\n\nAmi Reade Lindgren\n\nIf you are confident in your candidate winning, a recount should not phase you. Gore's recount went on for 3 weeks, and then he took legal action. If a person is going to endure an election wouldn't you want to clearly know you were the winner...or the looser. Either winner will be my President, but the winner must be clearly and legally defined.\n\n4\n\nView 1 reply\n\nKaren Matingou\n\nTrump declared war on the USPS just before the election. Any irregularities fall squarely on his shoulders. Biden was the candidate who benefitted the most from mail-in ballots.\n\n2\n\nDurell Smith\n\nBeing that I never received my ballot and I know others personally never received their ballots I'm sure there is probably more truth than unfounded claims.\n\n1\n\nDebbie Pullian York\n\nWe need media reform. We need the ability to hold \"Journalists\" accountable when they intentionally lie, manipulate, or spin the stories to fit a negative that creates chaos. Reporting should be facts not insinuations. Truth in journalism!\n\n79\n\nView all 28 replies\n\nSimeen Zhr\n\nGEORGIA: The people who voted absentee in Georgia, please check the status of your ballot .If it was rejected, you have until 5pm on Friday, November 6 to fix it . Please spread the word\n\n35\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nMichael Blytmann\n\nWendy Allen may i be so kind as to educate you on how counting ballots takes place. There are ALWAYS both sides present at all times as well as international election observers. This is a system that makes sure no tampering takes place. This election is by the book - period.\n\n2\n\nView all 6 replies\n\nKaren Bryant\n\nNo way in Hell I would have Mailed my Ballot, even if I had to crawl to vote\n\n1\n\nGail Houghton\n\nAs a Canadian watching your election unfold I’m in disbelief that the people have let things get this out of control!!! Your country is on the verge of civil unrest because of your very bad president!! You’ve gone from a country the was respected to a very big joke around the world run by a dictator!!\n\n2\n\nMarcos Zentilli\n\nHe owes too much money to Russia. Probably some middle east kingdom.\n\n44\n\nView all 15 replies","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":23965.70553399988,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}